      "title_ar": "\u0635\u062d\u0629 \u0633\u0648\u0642 \u0627\u0644\u0639\u0645\u0644 \u062a\u0633\u062a\u0645\u0631 \u0641\u064a \u0627\u0644\u062a\u062d\u0633\u0646",
      "text": "The composite AI health index has reached its highest level since tracking began, driven by strong employment growth, declining unemployment, and increasing Emiratisation rates.",
